      "extract": "In a seminal 2010 paper [@zagier-quantum], Zagier defined a new type of modular object which he called a quantum modular form. This new notion was meant to capture the behavior of a collection of examples from the literature. As Zagier remarked, these objects are reminiscent of calculations in perturbative quantum field theory and quantum topology. In the past few years, quantum modular forms have appeared",
